    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "A value specifying an ISO document has the format ISO-[DOC_TYPE]-[PROJECT-CODE]-[PART]:[YEAR-OF-PUBLICATION], where DOC_TYPE is IS, TS or PAS, e.g. ISO-IS-23494-2:2026."
  } ],
